A description lead under a marker-line child folds into its paragraph

```
- - a
  : b
    > q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>a
: b
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
* 1. a
  : b
     > q
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ol>
      <li>a
: b
        <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- - a
  : b
  : c
    # h
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>a
: b
: c
        <h1 id="h">h</h1>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```
